title: '? Record, in each fork, a fingerprint of the original it copied. Not plan-complete: four choices are open, two of them Jeff''s.'
pid: 52dfce32-ca0f-45fe-8b09-e24e083536c8
body: |2-
  At fork time, keep with the subscription a hash of what the original
  was: its title, body and contains. Then "the original changed since I
  forked it" is one comparison, and the fork is its own first receipt.
